The main cast members of the original Little Rascals film series, also known as "Our Gang," included:

* Farina (played by George "Spanky" McFarland)
* Alfalfa (played by Carl "Alfalfa" Switzer)
* Darla (played by Darla Hood)
* Buckwheat (played by William "Buckwheat" Thomas)
* Porky (played by Eugene "Porky" Lee)
* Butch (played by Tom "Butch" Brown)
* The Woim (played by Tommy Bond)

Note: The original cast members played their respective roles in the series from the 1920s to the 1930s.
